:SUCCESS
Sadly, despite the success of your mission the circumstances of the friendly fire incident has somewhat tarnished your reputation.
:SUCCESS
However, the casualties from friendly fire make us wonder whether you are really suitable material for a gunship commander.
:SUCCESS
Although the mission was a success the losses sustained from friendly fire leads to questions about your temperament. If you cannot curb your overly aggressive instincts you have no place in military aviation.
:PARTIAL
Regrettably the minor success of this mission has been negated by the friendly fire incident which demonstrates an alarmingly poor command ability on your part. 
:PARTIAL
Although this mission was not a complete failure, the circumstances of the friendly fire make us question your fitness to lead such missions again.
:PARTIAL
However, whatever success we could have claimed has been more than offset by the casualties suffered from friendly fire.
:FAILURE
Your performance was disgracefully inept. Not only was the mission a total failure but we have suffered losses from friendly fire. Your suitability for command is now very much in question.
:FAILURE
All in all this has been a dismal operation when you consider the friendly casualties together with the mission failure.
:FAILURE
The situation is made far worse due to the friendly fire incident during the mission. You can consider yourself fortunate not to be facing a court martial.
:END

