:TYPE MASTER_AVIATOR
:TEXT1
In recognition of your hours spent flying in the combat zone the air staff are pleased to award you the MEDAL.
:END

:MEDAL
:TYPE FLYING_CROSS
:TYPE SILVER_STAR
:TYPE DISTINGUISHED_SERVICE
:TEXT1
In recognition of your bravery in the face of the enemy above and beyond the call of duty the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the inspirational leadership qualities shown in the midst of the enemy the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the example your courage has set to the men under your command the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the bravery you have demonstrated which is an inspiration to our entire armed force the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the unfailing demonstration of determined leadership throughout many dangerous mission the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of your disregard for enemy fire whilst effectively employing all the weapons under your comman the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:END

:MEDAL
:TYPE MEDAL_OF_HONOUR
:TEXT1
In recognition of of your valiant actions in the midst of the enemy which have brought credit to our entire armed force the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of your unfailing demonstration of personal valour the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:END

:MEDAL
:TYPE AIR_MEDAL
:TEXT1
In recognition of your bravery in the face of the enemy above and beyond the call of duty the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the inspirational leadership qualities shown in the midst of the enemy the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the example your courage has set to the men under your command the Air Staff is delighted to award you the MEDAL.
:END

:MEDAL
:TYPE PURPLE_HEART
:TEXT1
In recognition of the wound suffered whilst in the service of your country the Air Staff is pleased to award you the MEDAL.
:END

:PROMOTION
:TEXT1
In recognition of the leadership qualities you have shown whilst on active service the Air Staff is pleased to promote you to the rank of RANK.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the unfailing example you have set to the men under your command the Air Staff is pleased to promote you to the rank of RANK.
:TEXT1
In recognition of the command ability you have unfailingly demonstrated whilst engaged on active operations the Air Staff is pleased to promote you to the rank of RANK.
:END

:OBJECTIVES
:TYPE KEYSITE_ANCHORAGE
:TEXT1
The carrier KEYSITE is the pride of the enemy fleet. If we can sink this not only will we seriously impair their combat capability but we will also seriously erode their morale.
:TEXT1
The major naval asset of the enemy fleet is the KEYSITE. Neutralising this threat will be a key objective of our campaign.
:TEXT1
Carrier KEYSITE is the enemy fleet flagship and their command and control centre. Striking this will reduce their combat effectiveness to such a degree that we will have victory within our grasp.
:TEXT1
The carrier KEYSITE provides much of the enemy counter air capability. Sinking this will so reduce their combat power that they will realise that their campaign is doomed.
:END

:OBJECTIVES
:TYPE KEYSITE_AIRBASE
:TEXT1
The KEYSITE airbase in SECTOR is the main command centre for the enemy airforce. If we can capture this we might paralyse their airforce to the extent that they realise that defeat in inevitable.
:TEXT1
The enemy air defence system is controlled from the KEYSITE airbase in SECTOR. Until we can capture this their airforce will remain a potent threat. Securing this installation will be a key part of our strategy and a pre requisite for victory.     
:TEXT1
Intelligence reports that KEYSITE airbase in SECTOR has recently been extensively modernised. It is the pride of their airforce and the hub of all their air operations. We will need to capture this before we can seriously contemplate victory.
:TEXT1
Intelligence reports that KEYSITE airbase has recently been extensively modernised. It is located in SECTOR. This is the pride of their airforce and the hub of all their air operations. We will need to capture this before we can seriously contemplate victory.
:TEXT1
A covert operation has discovered that the campaign headquarters of the enemy airforce has been established at KEYSITE airbase in SECTOR. The damage we would inflict by capturing this would seriously erode their combat effectiveness. 
:END

:OBJECTIVES
:TYPE KEYSITE_OIL_REFINERY
:TEXT1
Intelligence analysts report that the capacity of the oil refinery in SECTOR has increased significantly recently. This is now the major POL source for the enemy armed forces. Destroying this would seriously impair their manoeuvre capability. 
:TEXT1
Economic analysts state that the bulk of the enemies oil exports are now provided by the oil refinery in SECTOR. Destroying this would cripple their economy to the extent that they would have to seriously consider admitting defeat.
:TEXT1
Although the enemy have a long established petroleum industry only the oil refinery in SECTOR has up to date plant machinery. Destroying this would slow their oil production to a trickle and make the burden of the war intolerable for their economy.
:TEXT1
Recent satellite photos confirm that the oil refinery in SECTOR is the hub of their oil pipe line system. If we can destroy this then their entire petroleum industry will come to a halt.   
:END

:OBJECTIVES
:TYPE KEYSITE_MILITARY_BASE
:TEXT1
From Satellite Intelligence we have ascertained that the military base in SECTOR is the centre of their campaign logistics system. Capture of this site is therefore a key objective for bringing the campaign to a successful conclusion.
:TEXT1
Signal Intelligence confirms that the main enemy HQ is positioned at the military base in SECTOR. The capture of this might well result in the decapitation of their combat units and so dramatically shorten the war.
:TEXT1
The enemy intelligence gathering apparatus is based at the military base in SECTOR. Capture of this base should at the very least partially blind the enemy and the achievement of this must be considered a vital component of our plan to secure victory.
:TEXT1
We have reliable information from our intelligence services that the military base in SECTOR will be the enemy centre of operations for the forthcoming campaign. This makes the capture of this base a key objective of our campaign plan. 
:END

:OBJECTIVES
:TYPE KEYSITE_POWER_STATION
:TEXT1
It is reported that the power station in SECTOR is a key component of the enemy electrical grid. Destroying this would cripple their economy and this makes it a key target for our air campaign.
:TEXT1
Economic analysts report that the main enemy industrial complex draws the bulk of its energy from the power station in SECTOR. Bringing the enemy economy to a halt will be one of the keys to bringing this war to a successful conclusion and so this power station is a key target.
:TEXT1
The power station in SECTOR is a major part of the enemy infrastructure in the region. Destroying this might well place an intolerable burden on the enemy logistic system. The successful prosecution of this objective should go a long way towards helping us secure victory.
:TEXT1
The power station in SECTOR is a significant energy provider for the enemy military - industrial complex. Analysts expect that destruction of this will eventually significantly reduce the enemies combat capability. This makes this power station a primary objective of our campaign plan.
:END
:END
